["er.eventlog.import-anchor/1",{"authority":{"logical_scope":"aep","stream_identity":"01a0d3bf-067c-7068-af65-bd964ce78fcb","tenant":"planning"},"completeness":"available_evidence_only","evidence":[],"instance":{"entity":"story","fields":{"body":"# Story: One session per checkout, and a wave in its own worktree\n\n## Outcome\n\n`AGENTS.md` states the rule three sessions paid for, and the wave skill's pre-flight checks it.\n\n## Context\n\n- `3130470e#123,#162,#242`: a peer session's `git add -A` swept three unclaimed files onto public `main`;\n  `main` moved under the wave twice mid-integration.\n- `11727595#17370-#17397`: three sessions shared one checkout with uncommitted edits to\n  `skills/planning/SKILL.md`; a peer's unformatted hunks made `fmt-check` red for everyone.\n- `4d4c15a4#274`: five worktrees and build dirs under `home-path:sha256:c9b4a29c70118d6d7b16847048d915817c9384ab128f8b40318d83465ade94ce` deleted mid-wave with five\n  agents in flight, cause unattributed.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- `AGENTS.md` § Branches and waves: a session that edits works in a worktree it created; the main checkout\n  is for reading and merging; a wave records every worktree path in its wave page.\n- `skills/wave/SKILL.md` pre-flight refuses when `git worktree list` shows a worktree whose branch is\n  checked out elsewhere, or when the main checkout is not on `main`.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\nDetecting a second Claude session by process inspection.\n","document":{"events":[],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":0,"id":"ent-d0eb5b376f18cfb0db9f55ccf33e4693","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/one-session-per-checkout","provenance":{"created_by":"system","updated_by":"system"},"revision":4,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":0}},"body":"# Story: One session per checkout, and a wave in its own worktree\n\n## Outcome\n\n`AGENTS.md` states the rule three sessions paid for, and the wave skill's pre-flight checks it.\n\n## Context\n\n- `3130470e#123,#162,#242`: a peer session's `git add -A` swept three unclaimed files onto public `main`;\n  `main` moved under the wave twice mid-integration.\n- `11727595#17370-#17397`: three sessions shared one checkout with uncommitted edits to\n  `skills/planning/SKILL.md`; a peer's unformatted hunks made `fmt-check` red for everyone.\n- `4d4c15a4#274`: five worktrees and build dirs under `home-path:sha256:c9b4a29c70118d6d7b16847048d915817c9384ab128f8b40318d83465ade94ce` deleted mid-wave with five\n  agents in flight, cause unattributed.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- `AGENTS.md` § Branches and waves: a session that edits works in a worktree it created; the main checkout\n  is for reading and merging; a wave records every worktree path in its wave page.\n- `skills/wave/SKILL.md` pre-flight refuses when `git worktree list` shows a worktree whose branch is\n  checked out elsewhere, or when the main checkout is not on `main`.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\nDetecting a second Claude session by process inspection.\n","relations":[{"decomposes":"epic:self-evaluation"},{"serves":"vision:O6"},{"informed_by":"story:wave-as-a-surface"}],"status":"implemented","summary":"A peer's git add -A swept three files onto main; three sessions shared uncommitted skill edits; five worktrees vanished mid-wave.","tags":["process","wave"],"title":"One session per checkout, and a wave in its own worktree"},"lifecycle_state":"implemented"},"relations":[{"decomposes":"epic:self-evaluation"},{"serves":"vision:O6"},{"informed_by":"story:wave-as-a-surface"}],"summary":"A peer's git add -A swept three files onto main; three sessions shared uncommitted skill edits; five worktrees vanished mid-wave.","tags":["process","wave"],"title":"One session per checkout, and a wave in its own worktree"},"id":"ent-d0eb5b376f18cfb0db9f55ccf33e4693","lifecycle_state":"implemented","revision":4,"version":1},"order":"per_kind_only","subject":["story","ent-d0eb5b376f18cfb0db9f55ccf33e4693"]}]